            { "text": "Everyone knew the rules: never {forbidden}. So naturally, that's exactly what {character} did.", "weight": 2 },
            { "text": "The letter arrived {timeframe}, addressed to someone who'd been dead for {duration}.", "weight": 1 },
            { "text": "If you had told me {timeago} that I'd be {situation}, I would have laughed.", "weight": 2 },
